  "prefLabel": "He-A 509.04 Certification Period",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 509.04 Certification Period. A certificate for instructor certification shall expire after 5 years on the last day of the month it was issued unless a completed application for renewal has been timely received by the department. This shall not be the case if certification is revoked prior to the end of the 5-year period pursuant to He-A 509.06.\n\nSource. #10240, eff 1-1-13; ss by #13846, eff 1-6-24, EXPIRES: 1-6-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-a500.html"
